cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it as below."
title: "nirapod-slhdsa: SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) in Jasmin for AArch64 and x86-64"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  An implementation of SLH-DSA, the stateless hash-based signature scheme of
  FIPS 205, in the Jasmin language for AArch64 and x86-64, with a C API. It
  covers all twelve parameter sets, pure and pre-hash signing with context
  strings, and hedged and deterministic signing. The project is under
  development and not for production use; docs/STATUS.md in the repository
  states which tests, analyses and proofs pass and what each covers.
authors:
  - name: "nirapod-slhdsa contributors"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/nirapod-labs/nirapod-slhdsa"
keywords:
  - SLH-DSA
  - FIPS 205
  - post-quantum cryptography
  - Jasmin
  - EasyCrypt
